{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to schedule, ask about the cohort program, or clarify how I work. Clear boundaries, compassionate care.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fff7fb;--accent:#ff6b81;--muted:#6b7280;--card:#fff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);--shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fff);color:#0f172a}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,107,129,0.08),rgba(98,144,255,0.04));backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,#ffb1c0, #ff6b81);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:22px}
    .hero{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:flex-start}
    .left{flex:1}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
    .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input,textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;font-size:15px}
    button.cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#7c9bff);color:white;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .meta{font-size:14px;color:#0f172a}
    .proof{margin-top:18px}
    .testimonial{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .avatar{width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff,#f7f7fb);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a}
    .quote{font-size:15px;color:#0f172a}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center}
    .badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#fafafe);border:1px solid #eef2ff;font-size:13px;cursor:default;position:relative}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;bottom:calc(100% + 8px);left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#111827;color:white;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;display:none}
    .badge:focus .tooltip,.badge:hover .tooltip{display:block}
    .accordion{margin-top:18px}
    .acc-item{border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #eef2ff}
    .acc-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(250,250,255,0.6));cursor:pointer}
    .acc-body{padding:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfbff);display:none}
    .open .acc-body{display:block}
    footer.crisis{margin-top:18px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff1f2;border:1px solid #ffdde0;color:#7f1d1d}
    .pattern{position:fixed;right:0;bottom:0;opacity:0.08;width:320px;height:320px;pointer-events:none}
    @media(max-width:880px){.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{flex-direction:column}.pattern{width:180px;height:180px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">TP</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
      <a href="about.html">Why I Work</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Rhythm</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
      <a href="book.html">Start</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="left">
        <h1>Get in touch with a steady, pragmatic listener</h1>
        <p class="lead">I work with adults in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and remote clients. If you’re wondering how the cohort offering differs from private sessions, or you want to check availability, this is a good place to start.</p>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="meta">Phone</div>
          <div style="margin:6px 0;font-weight:700">{{PHONE}}</div>
          <div class="meta">Email</div>
          <div style="margin:6px 0;font-weight:700">{{EMAIL}}</div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px"><a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
        </div>

        <div class="proof card">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <strong>Proof Gallery</strong>
            <small style="color:var(--muted)">Real words from people who've worked here</small>
          </div>

          <div id="testimonial" style="margin-top:12px" class="testimonial">
            <div class="avatar" id="t-avatar">A</div>
            <div>
              <div id="t-quote" class="quote">Loading testimonials…</div>
              <div id="t-name" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="badges" aria-hidden="false">
            <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" fill="#7C9BFF"/><path d="M6 8h12" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              Board Certified
              <div class="tooltip">Licensed clinician, holds active state license</div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3" fill="#FF6B81"></circle><path d="M5 20c2-4 6-6 7-6s5 2 7 6" stroke="#FF6B81" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/></svg>
              Group Cohort Leader
              <div class="tooltip">Facilitates evidence-informed cohorts for skills practice</div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l2 5 5 .5-4 3 1.2 5L12 14l-4.2 3.5L9 11 5 8l5-.5L12 3z" fill="#F6C85F"/></svg>
              Integrity & Ethics
              <div class="tooltip">Clear boundaries, documented informed consent practices</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <aside class="card" style="width:320px">
        <strong>Quick connect</strong>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Use this short form to request a call or the cohort info packet. I aim to reply within 3 business days.</p>
        <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="return handleSubmit(event)">
          <label for="name">Your name</label>
          <input id="name" name="name" required>
          <label for="pref">Preferred contact</label>
          <select id="pref" name="pref">
            <option>Phone</option>
            <option>Email</option>
            <option>Either</option>
          </select>
          <label for="note">Short note (what's bringing you here?)</label>
          <textarea id="note" rows="4" name="note" required></textarea>
          <button class="cta" type="submit">Request a connection</button>
        </form>
        <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">If this is an emergency or you are in crisis, please call local emergency services or your local crisis line immediately.</div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="accordion card" aria-label="Session boundaries and confidentiality">
      <div class="acc-item" id="acc-session">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc('acc-session')">
          <div>
            <strong>Session boundaries & logistics</strong>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">What to expect for scheduling, cancellations, and timing</div>
          </div>
          <div>&#x25BE;</div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <p style="margin-top:0;color:var(--muted)">Typical individual sessions run 45–60 minutes. For the cohort program, there is a clearly described start and finish with scheduled live calls and optional small-group exercises. I ask for 48 hours notice for cancellations when possible; late cancellations may be billed. Details are provided before you enroll or book.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="acc-item" id="acc-conf">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc('acc-conf')">
          <div>
            <strong>Confidentiality & limits</strong>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">How I protect what you share and the exceptions</div>
          </div>
          <div>&#x25BE;</div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <p style="margin-top:0;color:var(--muted)">Conversations are treated as confidential. Notes are kept securely and shared only with your consent, except where law or safety concerns require disclosure (for example: imminent risk of harm to self or others, suspected abuse of a minor or vulnerable adult, or as required by court order). We will discuss these boundaries clearly before we begin.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="acc-item" id="acc-scope">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc('acc-scope')">
          <div>
            <strong>Scope of practice</strong>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">What I can and cannot offer in therapy</div>
          </div>
          <div>&#x25BE;</div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <p style="margin-top:0;color:var(--muted)">My practice focuses on short-to-mid term psychotherapy and skills-based cohorts. I do not provide medical diagnoses, prescribe medication, or offer forensic evaluations. When appropriate, I will collaborate with or refer to medical providers, psychiatrists, or other specialists.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="crisis card">
      <strong>If you are feeling unsafe</strong>
      <p style="margin:6px 0;color:inherit">I am not available for crisis response. If you are in immediate danger, please call emergency services. For emotional support in the U.S., text or call 988 to reach the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline. For other locations, please use your local emergency numbers or crisis resources.</p>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#ffb1c0" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#7c9bff" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <rect x="0" y="0" width="200" height="200" fill="url(#g)" opacity="0.06" rx="16"/>
    <g fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity="0.08" stroke-width="2">
      <path d="M10 30c40-20 80 20 120 0"/>
      <path d="M20 80c40-20 80 20 120 0"/>
      <path d="M10 140c40-20 80 20 120 0"/>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <script>
    // Testimonials and Proof Gallery rotation
    const testimonials = [
      {name:"M., 34", quote:"I appreciated clear guidance and tools I could actually use between sessions.", avatar:"M"},
      {name:"K., 41", quote:"The cohort helped me practice new ways of showing up with less self-criticism.", avatar:"K"},
      {name:"S., 27", quote:"Thoughtful, steady support that respected my pace and boundaries.", avatar:"S"}
    ];
    let idx = 0;
    const tQuote = document.getElementById('t-quote');
    const tName = document.getElementById('t-name');
    const tAvatar = document.getElementById('t-avatar');

    function showTestimonial(i){
      const t = testimonials[i % testimonials.length];
      tQuote.textContent = '"' + t.quote + '"';
      tName.textContent = t.name;
      tAvatar.textContent = t.avatar;
    }
    showTestimonial(0);
    let rot = setInterval(()=>{ idx = (idx+1)%testimonials.length; showTestimonial(idx); }, 5500);

    const testEl = document.getElementById('testimonial');
    testEl.addEventListener('mouseenter', ()=>clearInterval(rot));
    testEl.addEventListener('mouseleave', ()=>{ rot = setInterval(()=>{ idx = (idx+1)%testimonials.length; showTestimonial(idx); }, 5500); });

    // Simple accordion
    function toggleAcc(id){
      const el = document.getElementById(id);
      if(el.classList.contains('open')) el.classList.remove('open'); else el.classList.add('open');
    }

    // Form handler (local-only: demonstrates validation and demo toast)
    function handleSubmit(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const pref = document.getElementById('pref').value;
      const note = document.getElementById('note').value.trim();
      if(!name || !note){
        alert('Please provide your name and a short note so I can best respond.');
        return false;
      }
      // Simulate sending; do NOT send sensitive data anywhere.
      const summary = `Thanks, ${name}. I will follow up via ${pref.toLowerCase()} at the address you provided.`;
      alert(summary);
      document.getElementById('contactForm').reset();
      return false;
    }

    // Accessibility: allow space/enter on badges to show tooltip
    document.querySelectorAll('.badge').forEach(b=>{
      b.addEventListener('keydown', e=>{ if(e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') { e.preventDefault(); const tip = b.querySelector('.tooltip'); if(tip.style.display==='block') tip.style.display='none'; else tip.style.display='block'; } });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and notes for private practice therapist template (chunk 4)

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html  : Contact page with session boundaries accordion, rotating Proof Gallery, credibility badges with tooltips, and a short contact form.

Purpose and features:
- Session boundaries + confidentiality accordion: clearly states session length, cancellation expectations, confidentiality limits, and scope of practice. Includes a respectful crisis footer with emergency guidance (not a replacement for emergency services).
- Proof Gallery: rotates three short testimonials (local JS) and displays credibility badges; badges reveal tooltips on hover or keyboard focus for accessible microcopy.
- Form behavior is local-only and demonstrates validation and polite confirmation. It does not transmit data to any server.
- Navigation uses an alternate label set to keep the site distinct.
- Placeholders present for site-wide substitution: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.

Implementation notes:
- No external assets, fonts, or CDNs are used. Visual interest is implemented via CSS and an inline SVG pattern.
- This page expects other pages (index.html, about.html, specialties.html, approach.html, fees.html, faq.html, book.html) to be present at the same site root.
- Accessibility: tooltips are available on hover and keyboard focus; badges are reachable via Tab and toggled with Enter/Space.

How to test locally:
1. Put this file in the same folder as the other template HTML files.
2. Open contact.html in a browser.
3. Test testimonials rotating and pausing on hover, accordion toggle, and form submission (which is simulated via alert).

Therapist-specific guidance included in the content:
- Clear, non-medical language describing confidentiality, limits of practice, and referral pathways.
- Explicit crisis guidance pointing users to emergency services and official hotlines; the site does not provide crisis intervention.

If you need an alternate phrasing for any section, or want the contact form wired to a real backend (with secure transmission and proper consent flow), tell me what stack you plan to use and I will prepare a secure implementation guide."}
BUNDLE_END
